<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδη-φάγος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅδην</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gluttonous, greedy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.115
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀ. νόσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					313
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λύχνος</span>, of a lamp
				<i>that burns much oil</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.Com.
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>devouring much money, costly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριήρεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philist.
				58
			</span></i>; of racehorses, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				197
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				736
			</span></i>.</div>
